      "date": "2023-03-11T15:10:33-08:00",
      "message": "sprites: fix minigunner loop. (#899)\nThe looping sprite different size vanilla bug strikes again!\r\nThis one's unnoticeable if you look at the offsets or test on even ground, but *painfully* obvious when the minigunner is firing at something to the side while standing on a ledge - it'll just shift back and forth drastically every frame.",
